><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Water</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">45.3</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Main-chain torsion angles (%) in</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Most favored regions</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">87.3</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Additionally allowed regions</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">11.1</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Generously allowed regions</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">1.1</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Disallowed regions</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">0.5</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">r.m.s. deviations</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Bond lengths (&#x000c5;)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">0.015</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Bond angles (&#x000b0;)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" valign="top">1.507</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1"><label>&#x02020;</label><p>Values in parentheses are for the highest-resolution shell.</p></fn><fn id="tfn2"><label>&#x02021;</label><p>                     <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="s-15-00254-efi1.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula> = <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="s-15-00254-efi2.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula>, where <italic>I</italic> is the observed diffraction intensity.</p></fn><fn id="tfn3"><label>&#x000a7;</label><p>                     <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:hr